---
description: Use the installed Stripe plugin when adding or changing payments, Checkout, webhooks, billing, or Stripe API code.
alwaysApply: false
---

This project includes the official Stripe Cursor plugin.

When the task involves payments, Checkout, PaymentIntents, subscriptions, webhooks, Connect, Stripe Tax, or Stripe API/SDK usage:

1. Follow `.agents/skills/stripe-best-practices/SKILL.md` and its references.
2. Look up Stripe docs with `.agents/skills/stripe-docs/SKILL.md` instead of guessing API shapes.
3. Prefer Checkout Sessions for one-time product purchases on this static storefront.
4. Never commit secret keys. Use restricted keys and webhook signature verification.
5. Use the Stripe MCP server at `https://mcp.stripe.com` when account-specific data is needed (after the user authenticates).
